# Next.js docs

This project is Next.js **16.3.1** (App Router). Read `AGENTS.md` and bundled docs before writing Next.js code.

1. Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` (version-matched; starts at `index.md`).
2. Network: https://nextjs.org/docs/llms.txt — append `.md` to any docs URL.
3. Runtime (needs `pnpm dev`): `next-devtools` MCP — `nextjs_index` then `nextjs_call`.

`cacheComponents` is not enabled. Do not assume `"use cache"` / Instant Navigation APIs apply until that flag is on.
